.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-BOOTSTRAP-ENTRY 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-bootstrap-entry
.Nd public FileES onboarding forced command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the
.Xr sshd 8
forced command for
.Sy _filees-onboard .
It accepts no arguments.
The compiled-in bootstrap public key is a public capability: it can only
reach this command, and forwarding is disabled.
.Pp
The command performs exactly two steps:
.Bl -enum
.It
.Xr filees-onboard 8
.Cm take
.It
one
.Xr filees-mail 8
.Cm send
attempt
.El
.Pp
It does not enumerate tickets and does not expose whether an address is
free.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-onboard 8 ,
.Xr filees-mail 8 ,
.Xr sshd 8
